# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VERITY frontend environment example. Copy to `.env` and adjust as needed.
# The frontend talks to the backend through the same origin in development
# (Vite proxy `/api` -> http://localhost:8000) and in production (nginx).
# Only set VITE_API_BASE_URL when the API must be reached cross-origin.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Override the API base path. Default is `/api/v1` (same-origin via proxy).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1